Desai-Liaqat Pact ka draft formula center par interim power-sharing arrangement establish karne ke liye design hua tha.

• Option A is Correct because draft pact ke main terms the:
  1. Central Executive Government mein **Congress aur Muslim League dono equal number of nominees (parity)** appoint karengi;
  2. Minorities (Scheduled Castes aur Sikhs) ke liye **20% seats reserve** rahengi;
  3. Commander-in-Chief British hi rahega;
  Is draft ne 50:50 Congress-League parity ka principle introduce kiya.

• Option B, Option C, aur Option D are Incorrect fabricated options.

Is pact ne League ko Congress ke barabar 50% representation diya bhale hi League ki population base significantly choti thi.
